        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Reguitti SDK096PA Contemporary Rectangle Pocket Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll new contemporary rectangular sliding pocket door passage set that offers both fashion and high quality function. Packaged as a complete flush pull set that includes two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a square edge pull and all mounting hardware. Made in Italy by Reguitti. Available in 3 high quality finishes and fit both 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" thick pocket doors. The edge pull is pressure mounted into the doors edge. The rectangle flush pulls are installed with concealed screw mounting for that clean contemporary appearance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-rectangle-pocket-lock-privacy-reguitti-sdk096pv\"><b>Contemporary Rectangle Pocket Door Lock</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-rectangle-double-pocket-door-lock-set-reguitti-sdk096pv-pa\"><b>Contemporary Rectangle Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SDK096PA Contemporary Rectangle Pocket Door Passage Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/contemporary-square-fingertip-edge-pull-ahi-ep1273\">Edge Pull</a> Diameter: 1-1/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK096PA.pdf?v=1691093347\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK096PA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note:</b> The flush pulls <b>project 3/16\" off the door's face</b>. If you intend to use on a <b>pocket door</b>, please insure that you have <b>more than 3/16\" clearance</b> between the door's face and the wall pocket. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b>  two (2) rectangle flush pulls, square edge pull and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
